@ FITR v1.70 5/23/94 - Market Release Notes
. 
FITR -A -C -D x -E x -F -G -H -U -P -Q -Z Filename.ext
. 
 "Filename.ext" Optional name for user design file (Last item on line)
 -A Alternate Input File Format (Design.PLA instead of Palasm2.TRE)
 -D Sets Printout Level (x=0,1,2 - no check on range)
. 
 -E Expand Small PT's Assignment Pitch (allows looser packing of blocks)
 ...(x=Number of additional 'randomized' assignment cycles - Optional)
. 
 -F Full flag (allows more complete packing of logic blocks)
 -G Expand All PT's Assignment Pitch (allows looser packing of blocks)
 -U Unplace all equations (floats all pin assignments & breaks Groups)
. 
 -H Displays this Release Note listing
 -P Enables pause of screen display (<Enter> to resume)
 -Q Quiet run option (No text output to screen)
 -C Enables Upper/Lower Case Operation for signal names
 -Z Program unused pins as outputs (not inputs)
. 
 (Command line options may be in any order
& either upper or lower case, - & single letter only)
. 
